[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_HAI_FU]
Investigate §YHai Fu§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_HAI_FU_desc]
Now that no traces of smuggling have been found at regular trade ports, smuggling is likely to be carried out through some privately established docks along the southern coast — such as Hai Fu.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_HAI_FU]
调查§Y海府§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_HAI_FU_desc]
既然没有在正规的贸易口岸发现走私的踪迹，那么走私极有可能通过南部沿海的一些私自设立的码头进行 —— 比如海府。
